@@fx `a qualified adviser` : `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` ; `is an individual giving advice` = TRUE ; `has full civil act capacity` = TRUE ; `has a degree in insurance` = TRUE
@@fx `an adviser with another degree and the certificate` : `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` ; `is an individual giving advice` = TRUE ; `has full civil act capacity` = TRUE ; `has a degree in another field and an ancillary insurance certificate for advice` = TRUE
@@fx `an adviser with another degree and no certificate` : `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` ; `is an individual giving advice` = TRUE ; `has full civil act capacity` = TRUE
@@fx `a qualified loss adjuster company` : `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` ; `is an organisation with legal personality, lawfully established and operating` = TRUE ; `its staff directly doing ancillary work have full capacity and suitable degrees or certificates` = TRUE ; `is a loss adjustment organisation` = TRUE ; `its loss adjusters also meet the standards of an assessor under commercial law` = TRUE
@@fx `a loss adjuster company with unqualified adjusters` : `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` ; `is an organisation with legal personality, lawfully established and operating` = TRUE ; `its staff directly doing ancillary work have full capacity and suitable degrees or certificates` = TRUE ; `is a loss adjustment organisation` = TRUE
@@fx `an actuarial company with unqualified actuaries` : `A provider of ancillary services (conditions)` ; `is an organisation with legal personality, lawfully established and operating` = TRUE ; `its staff directly doing ancillary work have full capacity and suitable degrees or certificates` = TRUE ; `is an actuarial organisation` = TRUE
